@* A window's body (F134.1): a thing with nothing of its own to show yet. Its icon, large, over its name and a line.
   The icon is decoration, since the name under it says the same. *@
<div class="plain-body">
    <span class="plain-icon" aria-hidden="true"><LineIconView Icon="Icon"/></span>
    <b class="plain-name">@Name</b>
    <span class="plain-line">@Line</span>
</div>
